        "description": "<p>John Ternus, posting on X:</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>The way Steve taught us to care about every detail, every\nexperience, every person, still guides our work today. Forever\ngrateful.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/tim_cook/status/2107093457063805380\">Tim Cook</a>, also on X (with <a href=\"https://daringfireball.net/misc/2026/10/steve-jobs-via-tim-cook.jpeg\">a photo</a> I don\u2019t recall seeing before):</p>\n\n<blockquote>\n  <p>There are people who leave a mark on the world, and then there are\npeople who change it entirely. Steve changed the world and so many\nlives in the process. He certainly changed my life forever. His\nspirit lives on in everything he created and everyone he inspired.</p>\n</blockquote>\n\n<div>\n<a  title=\"Permanent link to \u2018Ternus and Cook Tweet Brief Remembrances on the 15th Anniversary of Steve Jobs\u2019s Death\u2019\"  href=\"https://daringfireball.net/linked/2026/10/05/ternus-cook-jobs-15th-anniversary\">&nbsp;\u2605&nbsp;</a>\n</div>",
